{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1450,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea46bee4a0b6ca1ecd818e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动神经好不代表\r\n舞一定也跳得很好。\r\n话先说在前头……这是两回事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c2cccbdc8d489936164575aca860c9df484d4c223105bffa024e3b0c37e74c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5644dfc55bf368769410c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真穿短裤也很好看呢。\r\n呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd81c2499161b14781cf7bffa5b4f3d87e9d33c4c0fa3f08763f662793727d2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ae762a497bed09b21f02fd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要变得比所有人都快，想必\r\n就连重要的比赛也能够跑赢──\r\n只要各方面都快得无人能及的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "636651622b1638218bd930966d590b1417b22e56baf59662b6e2424d985ccf19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c4421c52e2a7294d7072a6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真未来会成为超究极吉祥物，\r\n所以会变得很伟大。\r\n因为会变伟大，所以我才戴着王冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4a00ea5324ee80941f9ef33ba59a410ebe1eda3e60d24afd74cc72e53bfcdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fa538028bbaa4063696863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要一直当迷人小真，就要持续\r\n努力……呼……早上在洗脸台总是\r\n免不了一场激战……呼啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5809d5d0a158ad87cc3b9442e4e8254e9ec337975101cbe3d17ee7fc2e84b4be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7053e601eb4092d4e01ad6aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午茶的时间还没到吗？\r\n……（紧盯──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0650b061156257f6eb5b66328c3503a2ce9c085745be98c1c107055bbfce57ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6743179dd437e60a127846c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家里那个调皮的妹妹差不多要\r\n联络我了。今晚要怎么回复她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c0c08fb62bff1abd23b62c2ec6177118e91e9948339b8f2e07a852d38aa336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02e9013ae96cb3edae7c54f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是在学园或赛场，\r\n都有越来越多新的赛马娘。\r\n小真也必须加油才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d842197e6a095e920436a0cbd17b0c5f47f29ef569e492063256574e8119be26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fa1a8efbdd04d77efd35eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我擦了太多防晒油，\r\n有点黏答答的。\r\n要变得跟我一样吗？来，别客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9984e4f105061e213f0ed481a8eaa87976cc9c3fa4dbf2095bf826f04af0556",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4b9e7a1bc3bad5ff323033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年底的销售大战就快到了。\r\n开发商品、制作周边、上架作业，\r\n必须趁现在全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "592e4e6b8da58effde912b693a45625db641cc4d89a5e4b3e55418e5dae7cac5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c75cbe012a339f2f3945dae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外面的花枯萎了。\r\n……等到了春天会再开花吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f7420d7d897d5d2bfe79fdcdd01ec1bb245c7b9b82f83e6abf92e93d1f0d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2b278ebe1cebfeb80a7c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈做的曲奇味道很柔和。\r\n能够成为永不褪色回忆……\r\n我也想烤出这样的曲奇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "048664bedb0cc63c3940827aa472515c1ac163f9472bd422d5658c6d06eaa2c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9c57dbd97aacfe298402ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞翔学姐的穿搭风格既有趣又实用，\r\n相关照片还引起了热议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e61d63ab3a5f7f9fee166b5604870d3c9164ebafdf54666a25458c9afa8f11d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e5907d6dbfb9e58539011db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小花同学送的花，\r\n我试着拿去做了压花书签。\r\n书的回忆和气味交织在了一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e59916f54b34ee7cbfbcd8bbe33e95bcd1dec5597fae7a7579ea9af651eac76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28f1f7234cdbbf649754fd67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在使用上传到Umasta的照片\r\n制作周边，成品是能与充满季节感的\r\n小真共同出镜的主题日历‌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "618324b7f09e21b93cda15d156a732c406af0037a4913a845f0b84695003586a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f75d30a8eabda48be550a007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "二人对半分享一份点心相视而笑……\r\n我想要像这样甜蜜、温柔\r\n又难以替代的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c0f7114d55576c50660e1c05aba8027b4d0b5ce84a1634ed86f65ee640a4ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3328029298317f5c39b708d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被爱的小真之路也需始于足下。\r\n每天都要早起好好打理发型和仪容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8d30c7c860e6f1f53f8dee68854d9d56938bf10b6063d016a89332ef117010b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135bdb679327f9c53aeac8ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服上的点心灵感来源于\r\n小真甜点组合。这样的话\r\n就能有很好的宣传预期了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b5af47332c33672d161d19c9eab79fcdc37aef3d5c5eb0cbd6ad28dc3027e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6efcc62adc7c70bbe87b440e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一条尾巴轻轻翘♪两只耳朵摇啊摇♪\r\n感觉怎么样呢？小真的数数歌\r\n保证让你安然入睡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a61f29151a9dd1777eaee9159395320da2c7fd0617b757816eff3d0440ca220d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27732a1904eed74e32b040a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外面暖洋洋的，\r\n洗过的玩偶散发着太阳的味道。\r\n或许也该清洗一下玩偶服……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "212557c300cdbd10bab1ed188c69f989f5f6128cc3a57a04472e8693417d433d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:465255d28cbc98b12b9c27f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红豆冰淇淋永远不会融化。\r\n永恒是存在的。对此表示敬佩。\r\n只是，‌这样我就很难把它吃掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b39d6b6138586058b08666f66dba8f9788efd670c11f8df7296e428141866705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f205b096dbf6b23d4d5c4159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变凉了，到了可以穿上\r\n各种衣服的季节。一起去\r\n色彩缤纷的街道上拍人像照吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "179edec219d5ebb03a75bae250bf4fce024d4b389b6d7af6f820cdb882359099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0a25f043ad5c10ac5fb1d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍里出现了被炉。\r\n大家自然地聚在一起很热闹。\r\n仅仅只是欢笑，就让人暖暖的",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d1ce822a236c51cd5f5a06738556319c388a89ab339ecc51736ad46b172a37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20640f042395ef62daf5ac07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外观和穿着都很满意。\r\n要拍张照片吗？软萌Q弹小真，\r\n现在拍的话就是独家发布会了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9317dbd49b78415b07947f598b8261dc47023ad5baffdcff7535c0abcbb1eae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2a8834f646c9da264bffa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兔子化妆包很可爱♪\r\n我要把它活用到今后的\r\n小真玩偶周边造型中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48736c83d1a6f542d93a28d75f00a538e74a9c4be4635df98b0dc766fd152253",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6f9b9118e6bcc90e1a9854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经在长椅上摆满了小真娃娃。\r\n如果在训练时有客人上门，\r\n就麻烦你处理了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "505a6104bab98cbb2ccaad260002686f48f80f11a1ee852222ed482562cc14d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27439189abff6f230cef7fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的",
      "source_fingerprint": "125f28c5f90e711e1dc5503495b7a0c08e73b58143e3c372492d0cf84c50f21b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38fc1ab0c825be328e119e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚的节奏是哒哒哒……嗯。\r\n……要再更快！哒哒哒哒！\r\n嗯，就照这个节奏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eecc5c22e8f6144d78076f9ad0dd9dac26195afcf03e805f405b162615967d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2375855d4fbe4de0119e11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要变得能跑出一场\r\n足以上新闻头条的精彩比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5153f7eed31b9049ee8606b012268b0b0cad15f9ef2fc3ac79593910e64a98c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9e44de6eb632bf46d89b25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油喔，嘿。加油喔！\r\n……这首歌叫「加油喔」之歌。\r\n我明年一定会让它热销百万张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f3d72667b74303daa35626303923801642b83c2a181a483abd3de8f30211b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614aaf61bf5861cb9f225c75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起打造出无敌的身体吧。\r\n要打造出强韧又帅气并受人崇拜，\r\n专属于小真的身体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f03297220dac27f22a0119e5911d1bcf85834567dd5f41bc6b9481b69c69ca84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5e4a8c290327e4b5890802",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你期待我能有更好的表现吗？\r\n你觉得我能朝更高的目标迈进吗？\r\n放心吧，小真一定办得到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d4c191eeb1fc05a703ae9ea8addbd2496e44caa856b81e6a5d936e3fd5e597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a7605be13761f3243cb0c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是多艰难的训练都不要紧。\r\n因为无法实现目标，\r\n才是最令人难受的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d9bc4b162c4ea47cf0b17e30fe3b938f3aa31888c3e783157474c9fcc83909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305cd318f9bcc8d298f8935f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛夏的太阳也在为我加油。\r\n小真会变得比任何人都闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "869fd05c02a0b52dcd428a4b59185d6dc86bc7a3e2a7a4a2121ffe377ff40d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053a18a34cf95f1b904ac4f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "软萌Q弹的小真也得好好训练。\r\n飒爽Q弹，加油到底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3bb60c24e428f00130460a9c317ab547a455579a1c73028d47435b96f37d9da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb616882154b97eadea6067f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，发型也很完美。\r\n作为被爱着的小真，\r\n训练时也不能疏忽大意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54529b716efb43002350e015779af137028b80885c875f1cb041149a9d82136f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48692b9de6444a5a75fbe900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前考虑过的『要加油喽』之歌，\r\n正在设计舞蹈混音。\r\n我打算在准备体操中推广使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b4958701d642d245cc65be324ee59caeb31559cf322f058ab6587347c17e59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8dabf493242de2fc62aa922",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "观众们每次按下『马赞』，\r\n耳机里就会发出声音。\r\n小真之力增加了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a5f2128ec9f648213583247f2140f3a5fab7e2f1dd182eeb2c6f46ece794f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9dd65b721791bbf686aff1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣呣，能感觉到远处的视线。\r\n这是……记者的气息。\r\n看来是关注度上升了吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "561bd5665f220e1f2f75745c6963738008ae64c4cba1f3a0b15b09d8ecff5f11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88102815286e8bb6e1f2ae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天胜过昨天，明天胜过今天。\r\n要把这些都刻在眼中哦。\r\n小真每天都会像这样焕新自我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba88a0a1028332f7a724486c6ebc0ed5be86d5c771639028f478e9a3aca2cc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba60728eb75566dcf0fd1e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的日常，\r\n正在这片天空下不断延续着。\r\n‌无论何时，无论何地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed445edc2ceb398ccad7e30f72fed33f51ea0fcf002cdc236d57893263ed8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd27017ffbee5148b4337cdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要永远永远记得我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80d59531948320abd3e1acc16eb18fb9ee18e8b59d1060c4a165af456159070e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb0fc0cab9327c0b7566527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有让你留下回忆吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7117ebf7426dd2fef35dad29548eedf63099cea0bc627c58f5bc117b06b51ff4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e83a298e3c2cd83577deef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请别忘记这份甜甜的回忆哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3117dbcdcf026bdf79c3f61e88f649b26c952c80c176cdc211d23a8c2ee65c25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7852d2dfc8aa0ab08454ab86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正火热的软萌Q弹小真，登场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e18e7c1af3207275fa812ae9dfc68420387b7c729167c33ff5ccebbb9c5a16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2c861d0de507ccdce15d503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会一些小才艺的全方位艺人，\r\n才比较容易受人喜爱嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a2dc89a3a97940c8d31a6971ece7ece755779ebe2372cf1b253007e41352f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0c85178f94353f2ff87b19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵～请看。\r\n小真又变得更美丽了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2de8879ec4d010424d2ff6301daa3e72674904ef4a3ff33247ab46783de4308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37365d0216bb081fe986e735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是真弓快车。\r\n……请多指教啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f24812c05c4438a8caee5e0a7dbb6ce79cb33bf584364d02b998523cd8fe838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2bd9ebda20c71f37968df36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我叫真弓快车，\r\n是赛马娘……要好好记住喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ebad72d4b067aa20b76d632da1c72fa95bee9d488eda5de1779a2f9e7f942a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6f2df028b65f3b516a36cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力替大家加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3fac8883b37f2f20026843648b777a88702a9d98f61421b5676af113b3045b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ceb0a5b637425113d3f390c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "策画方面就交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0a7ecc95641fe2ac9cfa4968adbed6e6ee221dd2a99c94b49b5fb35d1cb553",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975c2adb138d8a78c0ebcb87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同比提升，软萌Q弹感Up～\r\n现已实现~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0473afc0907e77532263992bba03b8c37120f53e5bba361ed7bf161b652b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5a82a8dc1238929c9f212c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜点的多样性也得增加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70a5e943437138d6b9762f1b072497bfb70ce5a36d6a2af4379dd72030ef533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f6600f34f7ff34e32fb339a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "软萌Q弹小真，\r\n现在正是推销自己的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "915ef1f7e269d4d09934c8d7779df0663838107192816ac6d9a6ade46b226492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e031f1fe5df1198a085951f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是真弓快车♪\r\n一起来创造甜甜的回忆吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61431c0d43398530db1529fe162fbfc7effa736d930ae50c42c164f826367cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264cc438add34fc105b5a845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c574a9367b75f23f1cc25a265f9ff7951a2bab238c0f41c73d33cc7496abc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20658c805ea9a8d103c39562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么样的逆境我都会克服给你看。\n将你的信任与热情，\n化作助我前行的顺风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ffd6ac812c8ebe33200fff8a341ad549b54b0b97a766a1b924a8c575e16ca3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbfa121296cec4951a395fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8460d3b2b8d4ce03e5afc963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6751dfe306ea79492d45848f61a94cb9c4ec83cec4d271d8b9dfd75cb5796c29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3a0d7103c5489118da2a3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今以后，我会好好地\n把重要的事情用语言传达出来。\n……为了能与重要的人并肩前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e54e26f746e7244f2f5f34d0e1065db3f07041ea605ff836cd49d9a330112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7efe3bbcdb7855aac0b61e4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在香港如果有想做的事，\n请尽管告诉我哦。我会尽量\n安排进计划里的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00054bd4c675d0b0f63aee03968e1d6c02aead09da1655dd4e9285ada8005e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56cfa7d4f3e4c6bc7aa8388d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快樂！今年也有很多\n想做的事情。首先必须从\n制定计划开始呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "971040933ed444db9688ec2ba85b2a4938bf3b2207ba29d544708182f69db692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f2ea21a14aad7b24ee86c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine's Day!\n希望能度过愉快的一天。\n首先，要不要一起喝个茶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2559a5bc783b568291f3947c2e53e61b8beddbf9457dcfa49ce60f7b5125bd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7de1197c1ebdd4053e05be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能让大家玩得开心，我做了\n什锦点心盒！喜欢的口味，\n请尽情品尝吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e4af569debcb837bc0c3b75a7841cf07f6996eedec46adfd449ee8fd2b1caa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c357f11143726ba4362f2f1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我的话，无论天气如何\n都一定会横跨银河给你看。\n以让所有人都惊叹的、完美的方式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee6130ba5158c19d87f7fbf5aa3b7b4b7052527223483de5674a69e718206a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc257b09e047915c96e503af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "萬聖節快樂！带好糖果了吗？\n大家那充满期待的脸庞，\n真想让他们的笑容更加灿烂呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f22c978adae979e9e610e882073462df03646ad6896b06dac82e8d54469278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8bc16eed3162d034e5ba28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞商战的准备已经万无一失了。\n接下来只要满心期待地\n等待今日的结果就行了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143d0664de698d21a61895c2f08280144aee2fd0c007b739fe6b6ae9a9490956",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9819332df36e71d8347f0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真漂亮啊。无论是灯饰、\n圣诞树，还是大家的笑容……呵呵，\n今天似乎能悠闲地度过呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0202505a466d07fb77a2bf911ae0fefd6cb9218efcee7d0cffef7d2b4e90dc97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85019e3b0698795a29e32e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e209b4a4e06c4c463c7148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认事项检查完毕，\n联络也全部回复了……嗯，\n应该没有漏掉的事情了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c6595685d72f40f9b56ad6af53e8dd68ec3830e08944fcb59a7dc8ceac553f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41fe9b5d33e2cc432b2bb3e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快樂呀！我已经准备好了\n蛋糕和饮料，\n待会儿尽情享受吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b59b7e00620f49e12f885314bef78ce0d97df9a10f0f21c32381bf82c33e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ba1221d0824ae0dd9b650a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今天起又是新的人生了呢♪\n有什么目标吗？只要是我能办到的，\n我会全力协助你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a219e8dbc7c33d8e0ef99dccddbb086a856d5b8fb3bdf18878a28572eb01d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7f9821965f7302e0802b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然今天是特别的日子，但要做的事\n并不会改变。全力向前迈进，\n仅此而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a1d39f3827d88f0bd7c141300d95a34976b90c81d87ba7cfa463a9d9309890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ce7c5dcd9a6df474d81ea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……礼物？哎呀，真不好意思，\n让你费心了。不过我很开心。\n现在可以在这里拆开吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c08ef92ad2c5c28467ac03eb18adb9f5edcbe7bd0bb8988bad8de228bab9d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804fbc22b2c95c62ac45a32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新通知。\n必须仔细检查一下才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c3518cd8e4400ef02cf01cb77cd3541bf124b62626ce07d8419f38b9df2ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53867c0409a8119483c6cb3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦！\n可以一起看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcd1c205bfed768cf25b9bc04a91ebdd9facdce799744089f50c5e835494b0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:279eb4b2cfd33d81142b0daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了。\n你挺干练的嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22a760a37774807cd8c62131eca8cfaed586d89ecf204b153930ce198b95a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6c2f0a8d32c44b4a90f1690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎快要开始了。\n嗅到了新商机的气息呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48d9f4e47cdaedd82389e1a1f99fd7d72d8be42d1dcc0dd62cc30783ec1ad4e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e4c9b1bd61d6894c1e0b0ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了！\n准备好享受其中了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c6059db5eba62d12aa66e6e333452d6a6192c71e0a10c82425c66471984342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9befe80699602f49d29d3665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转换一下心情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60325510a74b32fca744cfb6121bde52364195975c7addd4a63d22452232b9f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
